            <title>2026/11/18: 湯治 その2</title>
        <link>https://www.don.to/diary/2026/1118-iwate/</link>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>この部屋は眺めも良かった。橋を渡る人と目が合うけど。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261118133420" data-timestamp="2026-11-18 13:34:20"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261118133450" data-timestamp="2026-11-18 13:34:50"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p>コタツ鍋。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261118142444" data-timestamp="2026-11-18 14:24:44"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>
]]></description>
        <dc:date>2026-2026-11T00:00:00+09:00</dc:date>

