  <item rdf:about="2026/1117-iwate/">
            <title>2026/11/17: 湯治 その1</title>
        <link>https://www.don.to/diary/2026/1117-iwate/</link>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>会津若松駅前から仙台(広瀬通一番町)への高速バスに乗る。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117073345" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 07:33:45"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p>バスを乗り継いで、平泉駅へ。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117100637" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 10:06:37"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117095521" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 09:55:21"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117100752" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 10:07:52"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p>自分が乗ってるバスが中尊寺行きなことに気がついて、予定を変更して<a href="https://www.chusonji.or.jp/">中尊寺</a>を観光する。
元の予定では平泉駅で一時間待ちだったので、一本遅れの電車にして観光時間を確保する。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117120838" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:08:38"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117121605" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:16:05"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117121717" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:17:17"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117121724" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:17:24"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p>金色堂。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117121749" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:17:49"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117121823" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:18:23"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117122422" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:24:22"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p>道真公がいたので、娘の中間試験がいい点数になるようにお祈りしておく。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117122725" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:27:25"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117122631" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:26:31"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117122755" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:27:55"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117123403" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:34:03"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117123905" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:39:05"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117123938" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:39:38"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117124006" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:40:06"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117124211" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:42:11"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117124302" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:43:02"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p>本堂。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117124549" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:45:49"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117124615" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:46:15"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117124830" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:48:31"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117125404" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 12:54:04"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p>平泉駅へ移動。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117131413" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 13:14:13"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117134254" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 13:42:54"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117135243" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 13:52:43"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p>花巻駅へ。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117143704" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 14:37:04"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p>徒歩でロピアに行って、買い出しをする。ロピア前からバスに乗って大沢温泉へ。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117145841" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 14:58:41"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117155626" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 15:56:27"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p>今年も来ました<a href="https://www.oosawaonsen.com/">大沢温泉</a>。
今までで一番露天風呂に近い部屋になる。湯治が捗る。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117163124" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 16:31:25"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261117163914" data-timestamp="2026-11-17 16:39:14"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>
]]></description>
        <dc:date>2026-2026-11T00:00:00+09:00</dc:date>

  </item>
  <item rdf:about="2026/1116-hukusima/">
            <title>2026/11/16: 会津若松</title>
        <link>https://www.don.to/diary/2026/1116-hukusima/</link>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>岩手に湯治にいくが、ローカル線だと始発で出発しても送迎バスの時間に間に合わないので、福島に寄り道することにする。</p>

<p>新宿バスタから会津若松行きの高速バスに載る。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116081220" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 08:12:20"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116081316" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 08:13:16"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p>会津若松着。これで福島宿泊。全県制覇まであと2県。
ちょうど紅葉シーズンだった。鶴ヶ城へ。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116135850" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 13:58:50"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116140113" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 14:01:13"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116140250" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 14:02:50"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116143455" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 14:34:55"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116144216" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 14:42:16"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p>茶室。表千家、裏千家の「千」って千利休なことに今さらにながら知る。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116144414" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 14:44:14"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116144421" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 14:44:21"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116144514" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 14:45:14"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116144523" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 14:45:23"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116145453" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 14:54:53"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p>飯盛山へ移動。白虎隊のお墓。団体客がちょうど来てて剣舞やってた。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116155255" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 15:52:55"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116160041" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 16:00:41"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116160426" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 16:04:26"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p>さざえ堂。これ面白い。最上階に上がって降りてくるまでずっと一本道の構造になっている。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116160903" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 16:09:03"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="video swipe" data-filename="hd20261116161228" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 16:12:28"><img src="/images/under.webp" height="900" alt="" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116161608" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 16:16:08"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p><a href="https://www.greenhotel-aizu.jp/">今日の宿</a>。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261116171830" data-timestamp="2026-11-16 17:18:30"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<pre class="address">
<a href="https://tabelog.com/fukushima/A0705/A070501/7019267/">鶴我 会津本店</a>
福島県会津若松市駅前町6-12
050-5595-1298
</pre>

