  <item rdf:about="2026/1010-toba/">
            <title>2026/10/10: 鳥羽</title>
        <link>https://www.don.to/diary/2026/1010-toba/</link>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>鳥羽へ向かう。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010094326" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 09:43:26"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010111359" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 11:13:59"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p>通りがかりの店で伊勢うどん食べてみたら大してうまくなかった。スーパーのうどんとタレじゃダメなのね。伊勢神宮行かないと美味しくないのか。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010123423" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 12:34:23"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p><a href="https://aquarium.co.jp/kannai/">鳥羽水族館</a>へ。
小学校の修学旅行以来なので42年ぶり2回目。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010124856" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 12:48:56"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010125810" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 12:58:10"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010130224" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 13:02:24"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010130527" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 13:05:27"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010130630" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 13:06:30"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010130827" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 13:08:27"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010132402" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 13:24:02"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010133003" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 13:30:03"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010133308" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 13:33:08"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010135732" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 13:57:32"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010135735" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 13:57:35"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010135736" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 13:57:36"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010140417" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 14:04:17"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010140529" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 14:05:29"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010140713" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 14:07:13"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p>このタコ、小学生のときに見た気がする。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010140901" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 14:09:01"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>

<p>三重県が押してるゆるキャラ、ミジュマル公園。</p>

<p><a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010161910" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 16:19:10"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a>
<a href="under.webp" class="image swipe" data-filename="20261010163522" data-timestamp="2026-10-10 16:35:22"><img src="/images/under.webp" alt="under" height="900" /></a></p>
]]></description>
        <dc:date>2026-2026-10T00:00:00+09:00</dc:date>

  </item>
  <item rdf:about="2026/1010-dinner/">
            <title>2026/10/10: 鳥羽でパーティー</title>
        <link>https://www.don.to/diary/2026/1010-dinner/</link>
